      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FANTASTIC ZOHAN (1) settled midfield in the run and boxed on to finish there when 4th (29.47) at Sale. Rates on top in this line up. PAW NEBRASKA (2) has raced below best last couple, the latest managing only 6th (30.45) last time in a Grade 5 at Sandown. Has never missed the frame here at the trip including one win. Solid formlines coming through her last run. Key runner who gets her chance to atone. REEL INFRARED (8) boasts a strong record this journey here with two wins and two minors from six tries. Was out of the placings last time (30.22) at Sandown in a Grade 5, finishing fifth and beaten 11 lengths. Among the main chances. TOMMY THE HOOD (7) surprised many when in the placings last start - deserves some thought.",
